# 20-Boundaries: Governance & Safety

Respect all repository boundaries and security policies.

## Governance Layer
- [Policies](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.policies/): Mandatory rules (e.g., [Code Modification](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.policies/code-modification.md)).
- [Boundaries](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.boundaries/): Sensitive zones (e.g., [Security](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.boundaries/security.md), [Infrastructure](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.boundaries/infrastructure.md)).
- [Capabilities](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.capabilities/): Explicit agent permissions.

## Critical Rules
- **No Direct Modification**: Do not modify files in `.boundaries/` without explicit permission.
- **Plan First**: Any change affecting economic safety REQUIRES an approved implementation plan.
- **Meta-Updates**: Fundamental changes to AI guidance must follow [.policies/ai-meta-updates.md](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.policies/ai-meta-updates.md).
